  {
    "id": 1009003020030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん、ぴーあーるってなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂はこんな子だよって、\r\n色んな人に知ってもらうことかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂を知らない人に、果穂を知ってもらって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂を知ってる人には、\r\nもっと応援してもらえるようにアピールするんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なるほど……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、あたしは……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしは……\r\nどうPRしたらいいんでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『色んな人に果穂のことを知ってもらいたい』\r\nこういう時、どうしたらいいと思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "色んな人……あっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、テレビがいいと思います！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お父さんやお母さんは、朝の準備をしながら\r\nニュースを見てます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしは、ヒーロー番組をたくさん見るし……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "動物の番組も、色々見ます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、テレビはきっといっぱいの人が見てるはずです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、いいな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、テレビの中で一番果穂のPRに向いてそうなのを\r\n考えてみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂が挙げてくれたように、ニュースとか、\r\nヒーロー番組とか、動物番組とか、色々あるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんな番組に出たら、果穂のことを知ってもらえると思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "うーんと……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ニュースはあたしのことを教えられないし、\r\nヒーロー番組も、役だからあたしのことじゃありません",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ドラマも、ヒーローと一緒だし……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "動物の番組は、ワンちゃんやネコちゃんのためだし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たとえばなんだけどさ\r\n果穂は、友達のことを知りたい時ってどうしてるんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっと、たくさんお話します！\r\nあとは、一緒に遊びます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お話して遊んだら、スッゴく仲良くなれるんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あっそっか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんっ\r\nバラエティ番組はどうですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お話したり、クイズをしたり、ちょうせんしたり……！\r\nみんなが楽しく見られます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "クイズは、テレビの前でできます！\r\n一緒に遊んでるみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、PRするなら、\r\nあたしは、バラエティ番組がいいって思いますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな！　俺もバラエティがいいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そしたら、バラエティ番組に絞って\r\n出演交渉してみるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出てみたい番組とか、希望はあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "決めるのは番組のスタッフさんだから、\r\n必ず出られるとは、限らないんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっと……えっとっ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ごめんなさい、思いつかないです……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020280,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、あたしのことを知ってもらえるなら、\r\n色んなのに出てみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003020290,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "『ちょうせん』ですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900302/1009003020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……了解だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるべくたくさんの種類の番組に出られるように\r\n俺も色々声かけてみるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
